    "helpful_mechanics": "Long Day provides more daylight for gathering and exploration. Common resources and simple recipes supply many accessible milestones. Fifty points come from continuous survival alone, so securing food, fuel, and shelter has substantial value. Contextual actions simplify gathering, and a science machine unlocks useful equipment and several scoring opportunities. Cooking improves basic foods, while armor reduces combat risk.",
